---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service';
const description = 'Terms of Service for Meowmin — your rights, our responsibilities, and the rules of using the app.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto">
      <a class="back inline-block mb-8 font-medium text-brand hover:text-brand-dark transition" href="/">&larr; Meowmin</a>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="subtitle text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">Meowmin — Last updated: September 2026 · Web billing via Paddle</p>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
        <p>By using Meowmin ("app"), you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the app.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">1. What Meowmin Is</h2>
        <p>Meowmin is an AI-powered diary companion. It helps you reflect, track moods, earn stars, and build habits — free to try for 3 days (280 chars, no card), then <a href="/pricing" class="text-brand underline">Meowmin Max</a> for unlimited journaling. The app and web site are built by Taucity.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">2. Your Content</h2>
        <p>You own your diary entries, reflections, and any content you create in the app. We do not claim ownership over your content. You can delete your data at any time from Profile → Delete Account.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">3. AI-Generated Content</h2>
        <p>Meowmin uses AI to generate reflections, insights, and suggestions based on what you write. AI-generated content is for personal reflection only and should not be taken as professional, medical, or religious advice.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">4. Stars and Rewards</h2>
        <p>You earn stars by completing actions like writing entries, enabling reminders, and sharing the app. Stars are in-app rewards with no cash value and cannot be transferred or exchanged.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">5. Account Responsibility</h2>
        <p>You are responsible for the security of your account. If you sign in with Google, your data is tied to that Google account. We are not responsible for data loss due to account compromise.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">6. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Use the app for any unlawful purpose.</li>
          <li>Attempt to access other users' data.</li>
          <li>Abuse, manipulate, or exploit the AI features.</li>
          <li>Reverse-engineer or redistribute the app.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The app design, code, branding, and assets are owned by Taucity. You may not copy, modify, or distribute any part of the app without permission.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">8. Purchases, Subscriptions & Billing</h2>
        <p>Meowmin Max (unlimited journal length, streak shields, family sharing on Lifetime) is sold on the web via <strong>Paddle.com Market Ltd</strong>, our Merchant of Record, and in some native builds via RevenueCat with the underlying App Store / Play Store. On the web, your statement shows <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">PADDLE.NET* MEOWMIN</code>; Paddle handles VAT/GST, invoicing, and refunds. All prices are in USD. Subscriptions auto-renew until you cancel from the app (<strong>Profile → Manage Subscription</strong>) or by emailing <a href="mailto:contact@taucity.xyz" class="text-brand underline">contact@taucity.xyz</a>; access continues until the end of the current period. See <a href="/pricing" class="text-brand underline">Pricing</a> for current plans and <a href="/refund" class="text-brand underline">Refund Policy</a> for 14-day refund windows (Paddle issues refunds). Taxes are calculated at checkout when required.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">9. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>The app is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from your use of the app, including but not limited to data loss or service interruptions.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">10. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the app after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">11. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms?<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:contact@taucity.xyz" class="text-brand hover:text-brand-dark transition">contact@taucity.xyz</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
